### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json

### Setup: Create an existing user for update tests
# @name createUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "newUser2Fodate",
  "mobilePhone": "+12345637890",
  "password": "ExistingP@ssw0rd!",
  "city": "Madrid",
  "countryCode": "ES"
}

###
# Location es relativo: /users/<uuid>
@existingUserLocation = {{createUser.response.headers.Location}}
@existingUserUrl = {{baseUrl}}{{existingUserLocation}}

### (opcional) Sanity check
# GET {{existingUserUrl}}

